    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_19970407.0546\n\nNEW DELHI, April 8 , 1997 (AFP)\n\nNotorious criminal Sobhraj deported from India\n\n\n\n\nNotorious criminal Charles Sobhraj, linked to a series of unsolved murders across Asia in the 1970s, was deported from India to France on Tuesday, witnesses said.\n\nThe 52-year-old French national, who served 20 years behind bars, left on an Air France flight bound for Paris, escorted by two Indian immigration officials, a witness said.",
